# from:length: counts characters and survives very large numbers
>> s := ['ééééééééééééééé'].
Imveliso bhala: (s kopa ukusuka: 0 ubude: 20), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (s kopa ukusuka: 10 ubude: 20), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (s kopa ukusuka: 14 ubude: 1), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (s kopa tsiba: 20), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: ['-'], umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (['abcdef'] ukusuka: 2 ubude: 2), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (['abc'] ukusuka: 1 ubude: ['9e300'] inani), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (['abc'] ukusuka: 1 ubude: ['-9e300'] inani), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (['abc'] ukusuka: ['9e300'] inani ubude: 1), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: ['-'], umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (['abc'] ukusuka: ['-9e300'] inani ubude: 2), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (['abc'] ukusuka: ['nan'] inani ubude: 2), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (['abc'] ukusuka: 0 ubude: ['nan'] inani), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: ['-'], umgca-omtsha.
